+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Actions below preview | Top toolbar | Original callbacks and document pickers |
+| Fixed 50/50 vertical split | Resizable portrait/landscape panes | Presentation only |
+| Category tool dropdown | Searchable category catalog | Exact instance selection, no auto-enable |
+| Cross-category search | Search beside tool selector | Original name/parameter search |
