+| Denoise, sharpening, repair | Detail/Repair inspector | Original controls and native calls |
+| Crop, perspective, lens, effects | Geometry/Effects inspector | Original controls and native calls |
+| Blending/parametric controls | Expandable section in the same tool | All existing parameters retained |
+| Drawn/repair mask controls | Expandable section in the same tool | All existing shapes/nodes retained |
